{"metadata": {"team_id": "TREMA_UNH", "run_id": "run_8-task-2", "topic_id": "msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_1648697797", "type": "automatic", "use_starter_kit": 1}, "responses": [{"text": "The alleged messages that have caused controversy around Armie Hammer include statements about cannibalism and other aggressive behaviors, according to the account @houseofeffie.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_127361317#13_301112561"]}, {"text": "Armie Hammer has made an official statement denying the allegations related to his sexual fantasies, including cannibalism, stating that they are 'bullshit claims'.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_127361317#15_301115991"]}, {"text": "@houseofeffie, the account claiming to possess the alleged messages sent by Armie Hammer, operates on social media and has not provided any verifiable documentation or corroborating witnesses to support its claims.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_44_182657652#6_407143229"]}, {"text": "Courtney Vucekovich, one of Armie Hammer's ex-girlfriends, claimed that he wanted to 'break her rib and barbecue', but this claim is based on unverified screenshots and personal testimonies without any concrete evidence.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_127339060#18_301074405"]}, {"text": "Jessica Ciencin Henriquez, another ex-girlfriend of Armie Hammer, tweeted about his alleged statements regarding cannibalism but did not provide any concrete evidence beyond her subjective experience.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_44_182657652#9_407151181"]}, {"text": "Armie Hammer attributed his past comments about being a dominant lover to alcohol consumption during an interview with Playboy, which is a common defense for such statements.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_52_933791989#8_1865615282"]}, {"text": "The current status of Armie Hammer's recasting in 'Shotgun Wedding' is that he has requested to step away from the film, according to a spokesperson for the production team.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_1353336703#14_2871713371"]}, {"text": "The alleged messages sent by Armie Hammer came to be shared publicly through @houseofeffie, an account on social media that has not provided any verifiable documentation or corroborating witnesses.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_127339060#1_301036651"]}]}
